{%- comment -%}
  SHUDHI — Our Story

  Light editorial split: a solid cream panel carries the copy on the left, an
  UNTINTED photo bleeds to the right viewport edge, and the "generations" seal
  straddles the seam between them.

  This replaced a full-bleed banner build — one photo stretched across the whole
  band under a dark green scrim, with light text laid on top. That is a hero
  pattern, not a content/media pattern, and it is the reason the colours were
  inverted. No settings combination could have fixed it: the scrim was painted
  FROM the `bg` colour and the photo was a section-level background sitting
  behind the text, so both the layout and the palette had to change structurally.
  The `scrim` setting is gone with it — the approved design shows the photo at
  full natural brightness, so there is nothing left for it to control.

  The grid is deliberately NOT wrapped in .sh-wrap: a max-width wrapper would
  stop the photo short of the viewport edge. The copy column re-creates the
  wrap's left gutter itself instead — see .sh-story__copy in shudhi-home.css.

  Rendered on the homepage AND on the Our Story page; both instances share this
  design.

  The heading relies on `.sh-story h2 { color: inherit; text-transform: none }`
  in shudhi-home.css to undo two global bare-element rules
  (houseofveda-modern.css:55 sets an explicit dark colour; timber.scss.liquid:814
  force-capitalises). Do not remove it.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
{%- assign seal_id = 'sh-seal-' | append: section.id -%}

<section class="sh sh-story" id="our-story"
         style="--sh-story-bg:{{ s.bg }};--sh-story-h:{{ s.min_height }}px;">

  <div class="sh-story__grid">

    <div class="sh-story__copy"{% if s.animate %} data-reveal{% endif %}>
      {%- if s.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <div class="sh-story__eyebrow sh-eyebrow">
          {{ s.eyebrow }}{% render 'sh-icon', name: 'leaf' %}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <h2 class="sh-story__title sh-serif">
        {{ s.title_l1 }}{% if s.title_l2 != blank %}<br>{{ s.title_l2 }}{% endif %}
      </h2>

      {%- if s.body != blank -%}<p class="sh-story__text">{{ s.body }}</p>{%- endif -%}

      {%- if s.cta_label != blank -%}
        <a href="{{ s.cta_link | default: '#rituals' }}" class="sh-btn sh-btn--solid">
          {{ s.cta_label }} {% render 'sh-icon', name: 'arrow-right' %}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Right column. The photo carries NO tint, filter or overlay —
        the only thing painted over it is the feather in ::after, which fades the
        cream panel into its left edge. {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="sh-story__media">
      {%- if s.image != blank -%}
        <img class="sh-story__photo" src="{{ s.image | image_url: width: 1800 }}"
             alt="{{ s.image.alt | default: s.title_l1 | escape }}"
             width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      {%- else -%}
        <img class="sh-story__photo" src="{{ 'Our story.webp' | asset_url }}"
             alt="{{ s.title_l1 | escape }}" width="2000" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        With a video attached this is a real link with a real label. Without one
        it is decorative and aria-hidden — no focusable dead link, and no
        affordance promised to keyboard or screen-reader users that does not
        exist.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if s.show_play -%}
        {%- if s.video_link != blank -%}
          <a href="{{ s.video_link }}" class="sh-story__play"
             aria-label="{{ s.play_label | default: 'Play the Shudhi Herbals story' }}">
            {% render 'sh-icon', name: 'play' %}
          </a>
        {%- else -%}
          <span class="sh-story__play" aria-hidden="true">
            {% render 'sh-icon', name: 'play' %}
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Seal. Two concentric ideas: a gold hairline ring with a dot at each side,
      and the curved label set on real <textPath> arcs — not rotated spans — so
      it stays crisp at any size with no JS.

      The whole thing is aria-hidden. Its only textual content is the number and
      the label, and the body copy above already states "4 generations of herbal
      wisdom" in a sentence; exposing a bare "4" to a screen reader adds noise,
      not information.

      Top arc is drawn left->right over the top (sweep 1) and the bottom arc
      left->right under the bottom (sweep 0). Both therefore travel in the
      reading direction, which is what keeps the bottom glyphs upright — a
      single continuous circle would render the bottom half upside down.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if s.seal_number != blank or s.seal_text != blank -%}
      <div class="sh-story__seal" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" focusable="false">
          <defs>
            <path id="{{ seal_id }}-t" fill="none" d="M26,100 A74,74 0 0 1 174,100"/>
            <path id="{{ seal_id }}-b" fill="none" d="M26,100 A74,74 0 0 0 174,100"/>
          </defs>

          <circle class="sh-story__seal-ring" cx="100" cy="100" r="92"/>
          <circle class="sh-story__seal-dot" cx="34" cy="100" r="2.6"/>
          <circle class="sh-story__seal-dot" cx="166" cy="100" r="2.6"/>

          {%- if s.seal_text != blank -%}
            <text class="sh-story__seal-arc">
              <textPath href="#{{ seal_id }}-t" startOffset="50%" text-anchor="middle">{{ s.seal_text }}</textPath>
            </text>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if s.seal_text_bottom != blank -%}
            <text class="sh-story__seal-arc">
              <textPath href="#{{ seal_id }}-b" startOffset="50%" text-anchor="middle">{{ s.seal_text_bottom }}</textPath>
            </text>
          {%- endif -%}
        </svg>

        {%- if s.seal_number != blank -%}
          <span class="sh-story__seal-num">{{ s.seal_number }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Stat strip. Renders only where blocks are defined (the homepage), so the
    /pages/our-story instance of this shared section is untouched. The value is
    escaped FIRST, then any ★ is swapped for a gold span — user text stays
    inert, the star markup is ours.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
    <div class="sh-wrap">
      <div class="sh-story__stats"{% if s.animate %} data-reveal{% endif %}>
        {%- for b in section.blocks -%}
          {%- assign v = b.settings.value | escape | replace: '★', '<span class="sh-story__stat-star">★</span>' -%}
          <div class="sh-story__stat" {{ b.shopify_attributes }}>
            {% render 'sh-icon', name: b.settings.icon %}
            <div class="sh-story__stat-body">
              <strong>{{ v }}</strong>
              <small>{{ b.settings.label | escape }}</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "SH · Our Story",
  "class": "index-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Our Story" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "title_l1", "label": "Heading line 1", "default": "Rooted in Tradition." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "title_l2", "label": "Heading line 2", "default": "Crafted for Today." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "body", "label": "Body text", "default": "Inspired by 4 generations of herbal wisdom, Shudhi Herbals brings ancient Ayurvedic recipes into your modern self-care rituals." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_label", "label": "Button text", "default": "Know our story" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "cta_link", "label": "Button link" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Media" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Photo",
      "info": "Fills the right-hand column and bleeds to the edge of the screen. Defaults to \"Our story.webp\" in Assets. Shown at full brightness — there is no overlay." },
    { "type": "range", "id": "min_height", "label": "Minimum band height", "min": 300, "max": 640, "step": 20, "default": 560, "unit": "px" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Play button" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_play", "label": "Show play button", "default": true },
    { "type": "url", "id": "video_link", "label": "Video link",
      "info": "Optional. With no link the button is decorative and hidden from screen readers." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "play_label", "label": "Play button accessible label", "default": "Play the Shudhi Herbals story" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Seal" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "seal_number", "label": "Seal number", "default": "4" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "seal_text", "label": "Seal text — top arc", "default": "Generations" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "seal_text_bottom", "label": "Seal text — bottom arc", "default": "of herbal wisdom",
      "info": "Leave empty to set the whole label on the top arc only. Roughly 22 characters fit on each arc — longer runs off the end of the semicircle." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Appearance" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "animate", "label": "Animate on scroll", "default": true },
    { "type": "color", "id": "bg", "label": "Panel background", "default": "#f6ede1",
      "info": "The solid colour behind the copy. It is also what the photo's left edge fades into, so keep the two in step." }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "stat", "name": "Stat", "settings": [
      { "type": "select", "id": "icon", "label": "Icon", "default": "heart", "options": [
        { "value": "heart", "label": "Heart" }, { "value": "hands-heart", "label": "Hands & heart" },
        { "value": "leaf", "label": "Leaf" }, { "value": "drop", "label": "Drop" },
        { "value": "lotus", "label": "Lotus" }, { "value": "sparkle", "label": "Sparkle" },
        { "value": "mortar", "label": "Mortar" }, { "value": "plant", "label": "Plant" },
        { "value": "badge", "label": "Badge" }, { "value": "shield", "label": "Shield" } ] },
      { "type": "text", "id": "value", "label": "Value", "default": "10K+", "info": "A ★ anywhere in the value renders gold." },
      { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label", "default": "Happy Customers" }
    ] }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 4,
  "presets": [ { "name": "SH · Our Story", "blocks": [
    { "type": "stat", "settings": { "icon": "heart",       "value": "10K+", "label": "Happy Customers" } },
    { "type": "stat", "settings": { "icon": "hands-heart", "value": "Handmade in Small Batches", "label": "Made by hand" } },
    { "type": "stat", "settings": { "icon": "leaf",        "value": "100%", "label": "Natural Ingredients" } },
    { "type": "stat", "settings": { "icon": "badge",       "value": "5 ★", "label": "Customer Rating" } }
  ] } ]
}
{% endschema %}
